    "summary": "Magnets are a fun and engaging product.\n \nBut small high-powered magnets can pose a high risk if two or more are swallowed. They can attract to one another inside the body and cause serious injury.\n \nIf you are a business that sells certain products with small high-powered magnets, you must ensure they are safe and comply with the law.\n \nLearn more: https://www.comcom.govt.nz/business/your-obligations-as-a-business/product-safety-standards",
